{"v":1,"book":"Deut","ch":33,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"And this is the blessing with which Moses, the man of God, blessed the children of Israel before his death.","tok":[{"t":"And this is the "},{"t":"blessing","s":["H1293"],"a":[1]},{"t":" with which "},{"t":"Moses","s":["H4872"],"a":[4]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"man","s":["H0376"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[6]},{"t":", "},{"t":"blessed","s":["H1288"],"a":[3]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[10]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"death","s":["H4194"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"And he said, Jehovah came from Sinai, And He dawned upon them from Seir; He shined forth from Mount Paran, And He approached from the myriads of holy ones; From His right hand a fiery law went out to them.","tok":[{"t":"And he "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"came","s":["H0935"],"a":[3]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"Sinai","s":["H5514"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And He dawned upon them from "},{"t":"Seir","s":["H8165"],"a":[5]},{"t":"; He shined "},{"t":"forth","s":["H3313"],"a":[7]},{"t":" from "},{"t":"Mount","s":["H2022"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Paran","s":["H6290"],"a":[9]},{"t":", And He approached from the myriads of holy ones; From His right "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3225"],"a":[13]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"fiery","s":["H0799"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"law","s":["H1881"],"a":[14]},{"t":" went out to them."}]},{"n":3,"text":"Indeed, He loves the people. All His saints were in Your hand, And they sat down at Your feet; Everyone receives of Your words.","tok":[{"t":"Indeed, He "},{"t":"loves","s":["H2245"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[2]},{"t":". All His "},{"t":"saints","s":["H6918"],"a":[4]},{"t":" were in Your "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[5]},{"t":", And they sat "},{"t":"down","s":["H8497"],"a":[7]},{"t":" at Your "},{"t":"feet","s":["H727