he "},{"t":"head","s":["H7218"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Joseph","s":["H3130"],"a":[8]},{"t":", And upon the top of the "},{"t":"head","s":["H6936"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of him who is "},{"t":"separated","s":["H5139"],"a":[10]},{"t":" among his "},{"t":"brothers","s":["H0251"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":17,"text":"Like his firstborn ox, he has majesty; And his horns are the horns of the wild ox; With them he shall drive peoples To the ends of the earth together. Those are the ten thousands of Ephraim; And those the thousands of Manasseh.","tok":[{"t":"Like his firstborn ox, he has majesty; And his "},{"t":"horns","s":["H7161"],"a":[4]},{"t":" are the "},{"t":"horns","s":["H7161"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of the wild ox; With them he shall drive "},{"t":"peoples","s":["H5971"],"a":[8]},{"t":" To the "},{"t":"ends","s":["H0657"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"together","s":["H3162"],"a":[10]},{"t":". Those are the ten "},{"t":"thousands","s":["H7233"],"a":[14]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Ephraim","s":["H0669"],"a":[15]},{"t":"; And those the "},{"t":"thousands","s":["H0505"],"a":[17]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Manasseh","s":["H4519"],"a":[18]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":18,"text":"And concerning Zebulun he said, Rejoice, Zebulun, for your going forth, And Issachar, for your tents!","tok":[{"t":"And concerning "},{"t":"Zebulun","s":["H2074"],"a":[0]},{"t":" he "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[1]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Rejoice","s":["H8055"],"a":[2]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Zebulun","s":["H2074"],"a":[3]},{"t":", for your going forth, And "},{"t":"Issachar","s":["H3485"],"a":[5]},{"t":", for your "},{"t":"tents","s":["H0168"],"a":[6]},{"t":"!"}]},{"n":19,"text":"They shall call peoples to the mountain; There they shall offer sacrifices of righteousness; For they shall suck the abundance of the seas And the hidden treasures of the sand.","tok":[{"t":"They shall "},{"t":"call","s":["H7121"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"peoples","s":["H5971"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"