shall be iron and copper; And as your days are, so shall your strength be.","tok":[{"t":"Your doorbolts shall be "},{"t":"iron","s":["H1270"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and copper; And as your "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[3]},{"t":" are, so shall your "},{"t":"strength","s":["H1679"],"a":[4]},{"t":" be."}]},{"n":26,"text":"There is no one like the God of Jeshurun, Who rides through the heavens as your help And in His majesty through the skies.","tok":[{"t":"There is no one like the "},{"t":"God","s":["H0410"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jeshurun","s":["H3484"],"a":[2]},{"t":", Who "},{"t":"rides","s":["H7392"],"a":[3]},{"t":" through the "},{"t":"heavens","s":["H8064"],"a":[4]},{"t":" as your "},{"t":"help","s":["H5828"],"a":[5]},{"t":" And in His majesty through the skies."}]},{"n":27,"text":"The God of old is your habitation, And underneath are eternal arms. And He drove out the enemy before you And said, Destroy!","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of old is your habitation, And underneath are "},{"t":"eternal","s":["H6924"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"arms","s":["H2220"],"a":[4]},{"t":". And He drove "},{"t":"out","s":["H1644"],"a":[6]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"enemy","s":["H0341"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[7]},{"t":" you And said, "},{"t":"Destroy","s":["H8045"],"a":[10]},{"t":"!"}]},{"n":28,"text":"So Israel dwelt securely, The fountain of Jacob in solitude, On a land of grain and new wine; And the heavens over him drop their dew.","tok":[{"t":"So "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[1]},{"t":" dwelt securely, The "},{"t":"fountain","s":["H5869"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jacob","s":["H3290"],"a":[5]},{"t":" in solitude, On a "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of grain and new "},{"t":"wine","s":["H8492"],"a":[9]},{"t":"; And the "},{"t":"heavens","s":["H8064"],"a":[11]},{"t":" over him drop their "},{"t":"dew","s":["H2919"],"a":[13]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":29,"text":"Happy are you, O Israel; who is like you? A people